OL,3,AMove to rejoin EU among options for UK,
OL,4,ABurnham tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham says rejoining the EU is
OL,7,Famong options the government could look
OL,8,Fat - telling the BBC Brexit has caused
OL,9,F"more harm than good"
OL,11,FIn his conference speech on Tuesday,
OL,12,Fthe PM said his government will end the
OL,13,Fexisting triple lock on state pensions
OL,14,Ffrom 2030 to help fund social care
OL,15,Freforms in England
OL,17,F"Triple lock" means the state pension
OL,18,Fcurrently increases annually in line
OL,19,Fwith inflation, average wage growth, or
OL,20,F2.5% - whichever is highest
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
