OL,3,AMove to rejoin EU among options for UK,
OL,4,ABurnham tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, from April 2030, the annual
OL,7,Fearnings link will be dropped - the
OL,8,Fgovernment thinks this could save #15bn
OL,9,Fa year by 2040
OL,11,FHe also pledged reforms to the
OL,12,Fleasehold system and to end "Margaret
OL,13,FThatcher's ideological ban" on public
OL,14,Fownership of water services
